#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:3
#: 9866e1f06195456fad9063a210694b97
msgid "原子扰动（Atomic Perturb）"
msgstr "Atomic Perturb"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:5
#: 60fd978edc3d4db8a80d0add71a5a331
msgid "**分类：** 扰动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:7
#: ee3fb7d8906141aea4d82be134b2dd30
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:9
#: 0435b49f5287478a9a9efd9c0b6f0d1a
msgid ""
"对原子坐标施加随机位移扰动，补充近平衡势能面的局部位移样本。每个原子的随机位"
"移向量长度不超过 `最大距离`（`max_distance`），晶格保持不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:11
#: cd1c4dd15b7141e6b845275bbcafa28e
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:13
#: b64da98f44bc432db1484e7daa39e1a5
msgid ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i=r_i\\hat{\\mathbf{u}}_i,\\quad 0\\le r_i\\le d_i,\\quad "
"\\|\\hat{\\mathbf{u}}_i\\|=1,\\quad \\mathbf{r}_i'=\\mathbf{r}_i+"
"\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:15
#: de8b586c1b0b45a88c4bb829b6d55b7a
msgid ""
"$d_i$ 是最大位移，单位 Å；$\\hat{\\mathbf u}_i$ 是随机单位方向，$r_i$ 由所选 "
"Sobol 或伪随机引擎产生。该约束限制的是位移向量模长，不是每个 x/y/z 分量各自的"
"上限。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:18
#: 2196ad6d85b74602910be8c791279ff2
msgid ""
"开启 `识别有机分子`（`identify_organic`）后有机分子团簇做刚性整体移动，避免分"
"子内键被拉伸。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:20
#: 271cc0eab9474eda8cd6de368ea89606
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:22
#: f760e16c3d2d400db0f991fd7624e1b3
msgid "场景：静力学测试集上力 MAE 只有 50 meV/A，但 MD 轨迹上跳到 200 meV/A"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: force MAE is 50 meV/Å on static tests but rises to 200 meV/Å on an "
"MD trajectory"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:24
#: 9898f82bd874450fa73453da6e2d568e
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，用 DFT 静态计算的数据做验证，力的 MAE 只有 50 "
"meV/A。但用这个模型跑 300K NVT MD 时，力的误差跳到了 200 meV/A——因为训练集里"
"所有原子都在平衡位置，模型没见过原子偏离平衡态的构型。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for Si and obtained a force MAE of only 50 meV/Å on "
"static DFT validation structures. During a 300 K NVT trajectory, however, "
"the force error rises to 200 meV/Å because every training atom lies near an "
"equilibrium position and the model has not seen thermally displaced "
"configurations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:26
#: 006d019a96514fa8875af01dd3ce1e66
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 静态弛豫结构代表势能面极小点。MD 轨迹在极小点周围的势能面上采"
"样，模型需要对平衡位置附近的位移方向有力学响应。如果训练集全是极小点，模型对"
"偏离平衡的力梯度完全是外推的。解决方法是对每个结构的原子做随机小位移，让模型"
"学习近平衡势能面的曲率。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Relaxed structures sit near minima of the potential-energy "
"surface, whereas an MD trajectory samples the surrounding neighborhood. The "
"model needs force responses to displacements away from equilibrium. If the "
"training set contains only minima, those gradients are extrapolations. Small "
"random displacements supply local curvature information around each minimum."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:28
#: 51f2e822692146d583e3dc6831987c6e
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Si 超胞（64 原子）"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed 64-atom Si supercell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:30
#: 09ccbad2c92f4b3d96f246a53b7bc8e0
msgid ""
"**目标：** 生成 50 个扰动版本，每个原子的位移幅度 ≤ 0.15 Å（约室温 Si 振动幅"
"度的 2~3 倍）"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate 50 perturbed variants with each atomic displacement no "
"larger than 0.15 Å, roughly two to three times a typical room-temperature Si "
"vibration amplitude."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:32
#: 1b22a37971a2428197c537ae7c431f6a
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:33
#: cc1279603ae44eb9a474d8a447efcaae
msgid "`最大距离`（`max_distance`） = `0.15` （单位 Å）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:34
#: bdef47d685134f1cb02c4a1d5187ac4d
msgid "`最大输出数量`（`max_num`） = `50`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:35
#: be293fd3b7b745e59355a1ef72e1703e
msgid "`生成方式`（`engine_type`） = `0` （Sobol，少量样本覆盖更均匀）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:37
#: f1158b5dc5c64ea0afba9edf8a9d289e
msgid "**输出：** 50 个结构，每个原子的坐标在原始位置附近随机偏移 0~0.15 Å"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 50 structures in which every atom is displaced by 0–0.15 Å from "
"its original position."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:39
#: 4f9613a7c55341a79c2fecf50fcf875e
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:40
#: a4a144a17f224545a454d80f8df30088
msgid "重训后用一段 MD 轨迹做推理，力的 MAE 应该显著下降，接近静力学测试集水平"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, evaluate a held-out MD trajectory. Its "
"force MAE should decrease substantially toward the static-test error."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:41
#: 3bbfe2f3052c4b8d802bc6468781f6f2
msgid ""
"抽查最短键长：0.15 Å 位移下 Si-Si 键长变化应在 ±0.3 Å 以内（两个相邻原子可能"
"向不同方向偏移）。如果出现 < 1.8 Å 的短键，降低 `最大距离`（`max_distance`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:42
#: 3fc7f4d9c7974876a1b3a8534b63dcb7
msgid ""
"如果改善不够，增大 `最大输出数量`（`max_num`）到 100、也增大 `最大距离`"
"（`max_distance`）到 0.25 Å"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:43
#: 9d1b28f2ecd44d349f729be4130916b0
msgid ""
"如果体系含多种元素且质量差异大（如含 H + 重元素），考虑开启 `启用缩放`"
"（`use_element_scaling`），再在 `元素缩放` 中给轻元素更大位移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:45
#: 4068c26236354c4caf74d995e14eeee0
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:47
#: c466882cadd944ab82ab60a462938b97
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:48
#: 7c58e590a79d45409000855b0b5577b9
msgid "训练集主要由静态弛豫结构组成，缺少力方向信息"
msgstr ""
"The training set consists mainly of relaxed static structures and lacks off-"
"equilibrium force directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:49
#: d9c7d0b2085041b586ffa64efb55d642
msgid "模型在 MD 模拟或非平衡构型上力预测偏差大"
msgstr ""
"Force predictions are inaccurate in MD or other nonequilibrium "
"configurations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:50
#: 0b032671893a4d009a096f183bb6861b
msgid "需要补近平衡势能面的曲率（力常数）信息"
msgstr ""
"You need local potential-energy curvature, or force-constant, information "
"near equilibrium."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:52
#: c03b59b662994553a66965dd993281ef
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:53
#: 89a35f390c744468bc41f6d4bd70fdf4
msgid ""
"训练集已有大量 MD 轨迹数据——MD 本身已覆盖热振动位移，再加随机扰动是冗余的"
msgstr ""
"The training set already contains extensive MD trajectories; thermal "
"displacements are already covered, so random perturbations would be "
"redundant."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:54
#: a20808b6a0e845ae83d5fe9f4d59c1c0
msgid "输入结构未弛豫——扰动一个本身就不在极小点的结构没有意义，先弛豫再扰动"
msgstr ""
"The input has not been relaxed. Relax it before using this card if the goal "
"is to sample a neighborhood around a minimum."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:55
#: e045e1657cd048999f06b69bce9475e2
msgid ""
"位移幅度设置的过大（> 0.5 Å），产生大量非物理构型——这种大位移应该用 MD 而不是"
"随机扰动"
msgstr ""
"The displacement is larger than about 0.5 Å and produces many unphysical "
"structures. Use MD, rather than independent random displacements, to explore "
"such large excursions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:57
#: 65914336174f457398f59aac2f3d37ee
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:59
#: da49f1655a6f4af18a709a9ea6ec29cf
msgid "生成方式（engine_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:61
#: 4b5170c850454264a3eb721233a9f060
msgid "`int`，默认 1。`0` = Sobol 准随机序列，`1` = Uniform 均匀随机。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. `0` selects a Sobol low-discrepancy sequence; `1` "
"selects uniform random sampling."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:63
#: 72658a473e1e4ce59c85ce2d43d970ae
msgid ""
"Uniform 是面向通用输入的默认选择，生成快且没有 Sobol 维数上限。Sobol 在少量样"
"本（< 100）时位移方向分布更均匀、各向同性更好，但 `3 × 原子数` 不能超过 "
"SciPy 的 21,201 维上限，因此最多支持 7,067 个原子；更大的结构必须使用 "
"Uniform。只生成 20-50 个结构且希望改善方向覆盖时可选 Sobol，批量生成或大体系"
"优先使用 Uniform。"
msgstr ""
"Uniform is the general-purpose default: it is fast and has no Sobol "
"dimensionality limit. Sobol gives more even and isotropic displacement "
"directions for small designs (< 100), but `3 × atom count` must not exceed "
"SciPy's 21,201-dimensional limit, so it supports at most 7,067 atoms. Larger "
"structures must use Uniform. Choose Sobol for 20–50 structures when better "
"directional coverage matters; prefer Uniform for batches or large systems."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:65
#: 05237380c6af421aa33144307cba9637
msgid "最大距离（max_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:67
#: 0b287eb117e64d12a08409d288acf8a3
msgid "`float`，默认 0.3。每个原子的最大位移，单位 Å。"
msgstr "`float`, default: `0.3`. Maximum displacement of each atom, in Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:69
#: 6bf0b74383c5461ab99ad5aa15e987c5
msgid ""
"注意这不是应变百分比，也不是 Cartesian 分量分别的上限——就是一个原子最多被挪多"
"远。室温下原子振动幅度约 0.05~0.1 Å，设 0.15~0.3 Å 通常够用。体系含 H 等轻元"
"素时，H 振幅天然更大，建议同时开启 `启用缩放`（`use_element_scaling`）。设到 "
"0.3~0.5 Å 以上时，跑完务必抽查最近邻键长——这个量级已经可能拉断键了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:71
#: 7757d55b137d466dbb893f18136c609c
msgid "最大输出数量（max_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:73
#: 465a537cb4d84d37b0f6913342d503ae
msgid "`int`，默认 50。每个输入结构生成多少个扰动版本。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `50`. Number of perturbed variants generated for each input "
"structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:75
#: a54aec32116a4ff28387bfefb446e287
msgid ""
"不是原子数上限——是输出结构的数量。20~50 适合轻量补样；50~100 常规覆盖；100+ "
"建议后面接一张 `FPS Filter` 去重，否则很多扰动样本在描述符空间里高度重复。"
msgstr ""
"This is the number of output structures, not an atom-count limit. Use 20–50 "
"for lightweight augmentation and 50–100 for routine coverage. For more than "
"100, follow with `FPS Filter`, because many perturbations can be nearly "
"redundant in descriptor space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:77
#: d80126e4f0e445e8b2730b6e0a15c9a5
msgid "识别有机分子（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:79
#: c79c53a6b37b46ceb760d8053c04dd1a
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后把有机分子识别为刚性团簇，整个分子一起平移，分子内"
"部键长完全保留。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. When enabled, detected organic molecules are "
"treated as rigid clusters and translated as units, preserving all "
"intramolecular bond lengths."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:81
#: ec909bd7031e4475ae28aac98442bb11
msgid ""
"你的体系是纯无机的（金属、氧化物、半导体）→ 关着就行，开了反而多算一堆团簇检"
"测。体系含有机分子 → 必须开，否则每个原子独立随机位移会把分子撕碎。"
msgstr ""
"For purely inorganic metals, oxides, or semiconductors, leave this disabled "
"to avoid unnecessary cluster detection. Enable it for systems containing "
"organic molecules; otherwise independent atomic displacements can distort or "
"tear the molecules apart."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:83
#: 6b6525588a0642fea2e00a470271be04
msgid "启用缩放（use_element_scaling）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:85
#: 194f3abe6162471a96df2c241696b5b8
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。对应界面中的 `Enable Scaling`。打开后显示下方的 `Element "
"Scaling` 配置，不同元素可以使用不同的最大位移；关闭时全部元素使用全局 `最大距"
"离`（`max_distance`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:87
#: ff045e076aa24c8ba9bb772f3d2c07bb
msgid ""
"多元素体系（比如含 H + 重元素）建议开。H 在室温下的振动幅度远大于重元素，用同"
"一个 `最大距离`（`max_distance`）会导致要么 H 位移太小、要么重元素位移太大。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:89
#: fd71d56991db4d4fa4edb4815f8f30ca
msgid "元素缩放（element_scalings）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:91
#: 4a71b02246734e67849d1b936cf9a790
msgid ""
"`dict[str, float] | None`，默认 None。对应界面中的 `Element Scaling`，表示“元"
"素 → 最大位移”的映射，数值单位为 Å；它不是无量纲缩放系数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:93
#: 1e3fcb791fde421e91f55af98a09c114
msgid ""
"格式如 `{\"H\": 0.5, \"O\": 0.15, \"Si\": 0.1}`。只对列出的元素生效，没列出的"
"元素仍然用上面的 `最大距离`（`max_distance`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:95
#: df0dc54f03274a198c645c43148fa174
msgid ""
"生效条件：`启用缩放`（`use_element_scaling`）必须为 true。未列出的元素继续使"
"用全局 `最大距离`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:97
#: 301bde6cff584171a6967f2da99471d0
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:99
#: 8054a417a107455eaae5080eb4b6eb0d
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后每次跑同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed → 完全相同的"
"扰动结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. When enabled, the same input, parameters, and seed "
"reproduce exactly the same perturbations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:101
#: f9325996ff594b2cb8cc9ee3e5dbd0c8
msgid ""
"对比实验或者需要复现时打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。seed 会与单帧结构内容共同派"
"生，因此几何不同的帧不会机械复用同一组位移；重新排列数据集不会改变某一帧自己"
"的结果。完全相同的重复帧仍会得到相同扰动，若希望把重复帧扩成不同样本，应先去"
"重或分批使用不同 seed。"
msgstr ""
"Enable it for controlled comparisons or reproducibility; leave it off for "
"unconstrained exploration. The seed is combined with each structure's "
"content, so geometrically different frames do not reuse the same "
"displacements, and reordering the dataset does not change a frame's result. "
"Exactly duplicated frames still receive identical perturbations; deduplicate "
"them or process batches with different seeds when distinct augmentation is "
"wanted."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:103
